  "details": "VRCStation does not match the expectations set by other classes accessible in Udon, making it unnecessarily difficult to use, and highly susceptible to inexplicable catastrophes and hidden rules. Among these issues are such defects as:\n\n1. You cannot call a method in another script from within a script that's on a gameobject with a VRC Station on it.\n\n2. You cannot run more than one child gameobject with a script with an Interactor on it under a gameobject with VRC Station on it.\n\n3. VRC Station conflates hip position and playspace origin, when only hip position is relevant.",
